Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 18:14:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 11/22] [M156] Retarget coalesced and predicted PointerEvents
 across shadow boundaries

Original change's description:
> Retarget coalesced and predicted PointerEvents across shadow boundaries
>
> PointerEvent::DispatchEvent previously set the unadjusted target node on
> all coalesced and predicted events, leaking shadow DOM nodes.
>
> This CL retargets coalesced and predicted sublists across shadow
> boundaries via EventPath, storing them in a new PointerEventContext and
> swapping them in during dispatch (cloning sub-events for outer trees).
>
> Fixed: 515272369, 583179913
> Bug: 584078810
> Change-Id: I4c4c35170c0bf576a8c6f4e034b1857681c6a629
> Reviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/8806795
> Reviewed-by: Joey Arhar <jarhar@chromium.org>
> Commit-Queue: Mustaq Ahmed <mustaq@chromium.org>
